{"4434360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Creator: Live Together", "steam_appid": 4434360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4804320], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a world where creativity is part of everyday life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Creator: Live Together</strong> brings creativity, co-op gameplay, and progression together in one immersive experience. Take on a variety of jobs, unlock new opportunities, design beautiful spaces, and bring your ideas to life. Build your career through a rewarding progression system or enjoy complete creative freedom in Sandbox Mode.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/396ae3d0a43267c96b689417a796d970.poster.avif?t=1787542251\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/396ae3d0a43267c96b689417a796d970.webm?t=1787542251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/396ae3d0a43267c96b689417a796d970.mp4?t=1787542251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Career</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a wide variety of jobs, help local residents, clean homes and outdoor areas, deliver goods, decorate interiors and exteriors, and complete many other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly <strong>3,000</strong> furniture pieces, decorations, and interior and exterior items, you'll have everything you need to create incredible spaces. Experiment with layouts and transform empty places into warm, inviting environments you'll always want to come back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience, unlock new jobs, items, and opportunities, and take on increasingly ambitious projects as your career grows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/17df2e3312185818b57e170c99b3d6eb.poster.avif?t=1787542251\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/17df2e3312185818b57e170c99b3d6eb.webm?t=1787542251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/17df2e3312185818b57e170c99b3d6eb.mp4?t=1787542251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock every item and tool from the very beginning, and create anything you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design dream homes, decorate outdoor spaces, experiment with different styles, and bring your ideas to life without limits.<br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Career &amp; Sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your career by completing jobs and unlocking new opportunities, or enjoy unlimited creative freedom in Sandbox Mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design homes, decorate interiors and outdoor spaces, and create unique places with thousands of furniture and decoration items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Jobs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help residents, clean homes and neighborhoods, deliver goods, decorate spaces, and take on many different types of work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world, discover new places, and enjoy life at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jobs, build, decorate, and explore together with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community Creations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your Sandbox creations in the in-game gallery. Outstanding projects selected by the developers can become official career jobs for all players.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a world where creativity is part of everyday life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Creator: Live Together</strong> brings creativity, co-op gameplay, and progression together in one immersive experience. Take on a variety of jobs, unlock new opportunities, design beautiful spaces, and bring your ideas to life. Build your career through a rewarding progression system or enjoy complete creative freedom in Sandbox Mode.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/396ae3d0a43267c96b689417a796d970.poster.avif?t=1787542251\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/396ae3d0a43267c96b689417a796d970.webm?t=1787542251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/396ae3d0a43267c96b689417a796d970.mp4?t=1787542251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Career</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a wide variety of jobs, help local residents, clean homes and outdoor areas, deliver goods, decorate interiors and exteriors, and complete many other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly <strong>3,000</strong> furniture pieces, decorations, and interior and exterior items, you'll have everything you need to create incredible spaces. Experiment with layouts and transform empty places into warm, inviting environments you'll always want to come back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience, unlock new jobs, items, and opportunities, and take on increasingly ambitious projects as your career grows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/17df2e3312185818b57e170c99b3d6eb.poster.avif?t=1787542251\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/17df2e3312185818b57e170c99b3d6eb.webm?t=1787542251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/extras/17df2e3312185818b57e170c99b3d6eb.mp4?t=1787542251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock every item and tool from the very beginning, and create anything you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design dream homes, decorate outdoor spaces, experiment with different styles, and bring your ideas to life without limits.<br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Career &amp; Sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your career by completing jobs and unlocking new opportunities, or enjoy unlimited creative freedom in Sandbox Mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design homes, decorate interiors and outdoor spaces, and create unique places with thousands of furniture and decoration items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Jobs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help residents, clean homes and neighborhoods, deliver goods, decorate spaces, and take on many different types of work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world, discover new places, and enjoy life at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jobs, build, decorate, and explore together with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community Creations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your Sandbox creations in the in-game gallery. Outstanding projects selected by the developers can become official career jobs for all players.</p>", "short_description": "The Creator: Live Together — a world built for creativity. Take on jobs, build your career, or create freely in Sandbox Mode. Design dream homes, craft cozy spaces, and play with friends.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Japanese, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/33330da0bdd7f0f613e77ec248609e89713cfcf1/header.jpg?t=1787542251", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/0dfd85983b5ad16af39f5019f346065ab80cf135/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787542251", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434360/0dfd85983b5ad16af39f5019f346065ab80cf135/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787542251", "website": "https://creatorgame.website/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD processor, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 470 GTX or AMD Radeon 6870 HD series card or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional 